#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522816"
msgid "How awful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522952"
msgid "At a glance, they appear to be human, but…\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, which are they? NPCs or Masters?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523296"
msgid "Uuh… aah… So sleepy… tired…\nIs… someone there…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523808"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is staring morosely at these pinned people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523968"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF stares coldly at the bloodstained torture chamber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524124"
msgid "U-uaa… ah… ah…\nGive… it back… Please… no more.\nI'll stay, here forever, just give…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524292"
msgid "My―\nGive me back my abilitieessss!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524552"
msgid "…the reverse of a designer baby.\nIn this room, geniuses are physically turned\ninto commonfolk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525092"
msgid "But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525876"
msgid "…how unexpected. To think my Master would\nreaffirm themselves before a prison like\nthis."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526048"
msgid "Your anger is justified. Be shameless in bashing\nthat Servant's head in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526244"
msgid "…for me, I hold no indignation over this.\nI am unqualified to feel such.\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526344"
msgid "However, if my Darling were to ever meet with\nthis fate, I would likely turn into a wrathful\nmonster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527132"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's voice loosens my strained mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527444"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

